    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/releases/tag/v15.0.0"&gt;v15.0.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/compare/v14.0.0...v15.0.0"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v14.0.0...v15.0.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for .NET Standard 2.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requiring license key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving from MIT license to dual commercial/OSS license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To set your license key:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="services.AddAutoMapper(cfg =&amp;gt; {
    cfg.LicenseKey = &amp;quot;&amp;lt;License key here&amp;gt;&amp;quot;;
});"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;AddAutoMapper&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;cfg &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;cfg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;LicenseKey&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s"&gt;"&amp;lt;License key here&amp;gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can obtain your license key at &lt;a href="https://automapper.io" rel="nofollow"&gt;AutoMapper.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
